  "design": {
    "idea": "Hall of Shifting Eyes: four painted Watcher Portraits slide heavy bookcases whenever they see light; pin your lantern on hooks to hold gates open while slipping past hostile eyes in Shutter Hood darkness, and use Dusk to freeze their gaze.",
    "kind": "puzzle",
    "beat": "ten",
    "teaches": "Weaponizing Shutter Hood darkness + pinned lantern hooks + Dusk freezes turns hostile Watcher Portraits into living architectural keys.",
